LANG_ENGLISH        "The Tactical View gives a strategic view of the battlefield where you can see your squad, enemy troops and objectives.\n\nCommanding squads from the Tactical View is identical to commanding squads on the ground.\n\nPress the ^BBUTTON_MP_CANCELCOMMAND^ to access the Tactical View.\n\nTo exit the Tactical View and switch back to a squad on the ground, you can hold the directional buttons or position the cursor over a squad member and press the ^BBUTTON_MP_CANCELCOMMAND^."

